  "description": "Preview, not production ready. Microsoft Agent Framework (MAF) adapter for AgentExperience.NET: one AIAgentBuilder.UseExperienceCapture(...) call records every MAF invocation (ordinary, streaming, failed, cancelled, or abandoned mid-stream) and its tool calls as a sanitized Experience Run through AgentExperience.Core's IExperienceCaptureService, and an ExperienceContextProvider injects the verified lessons that apply before the model is called. With services.AddAgentExperience(...), one AIAgentBuilder.UseAgentExperience(services) call wires both. Requires Microsoft.Agents.AI 1.22.0 or any later 1.x, and Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting.Abstractions 10.0.3 or later within the same major.",
